	(text "J30 (MC 1,5/10-G-3,5 header, 7.7 mm: fits under the next card; plug FMC 1,5/10-ST-3,5 push-in):\n1/2 OUT1 / 0 V, 3/4 OUT2 / 0 V, 5/6 OUT3 / 0 V, 7/8 OUT4 / 0 V (OUTn = coil +, V_RLY when on),\n9/10 external coil supply + / 0 V (0 V = GND_RACK). Coils up to about 100 mA each; F30 1.1 A hold\nfor all four. LEDs: 2 mA at 12 V, 4.7 mA at 24 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a08f3f92-9307-4fcb-9a42-629bc89ac863")
	)
	(text "GPIO (requirements 4.1): four 3.3 V lines straight from core PIC32 pins (in or out). 330R in series and a\nBAT54S clamp to +3V3/GND at the card: ESD and a brief 5 V short only, NOT 24 V tolerant."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51498bb5-5cfc-43b4-a5ab-1c6527142c7e")
	)
